    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わたし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わたしはこの時期、いつも湯治するんだ。わたし、身体が弱いから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ここの温泉、すごく気にいってる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「湯治は、全国でしてみたけど。ここがいちばん馴染むよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「家からも近いしね、楽なんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「温泉に浸かってる間だけは、ふつうに呼吸もできるし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「それが嬉しいんだよ。コホ、コホ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「とりあえず、宿帳だけ書かせてもらっていい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
